# test: init_onramp
# description: A fresh installation opens a fifteen-minute phone pairing on-ramp

## Environment

config:
  name: local
  host_name: nova

terminal:
  name: Admin
  config: local
  installation: true

## Test

@Admin
> amux init
@@contains Installation ready. Run `amux login` to connect a cloud account.
@@contains Pairing code:
@@contains · valid for 15 minutes
@@contains On your phone, install amux, and it will find nova on this network.
@@contains Run `amux pair` for a fresh code.
@@contains amux is free on your network. Sign in to reach your agents from anywhere: amux login
